    \ afternoon using AI.\n\nUpgrade your web UI right now at https://t.co/RlChWqggj8\
    \ ✨\n\nHere is how to build an immersive experience that physically pulls users\
    \ into your product. Zero bloated code.\n\nThe exact frontend tech stack: \n✅\
    \ React & Next.js (Core component architecture) \n✅ HTML5 Canvas (High-performance\
    \ image sequence rendering) \n✅ GSAP ScrollTrigger (Z-axis camera fly-through\
    \ physics) \n✅ Tailwind CSS (Clean typography & dynamic progress UI)\n\nCopy my\
    \ prompt \U0001F447"
