- id: '2083310529821466880'
  text: 'ONE CLAUDE WORKFLOW BUILT $200K AGENCY WEBSITES


    NOW NOBODY WANTS TO PAY FOR IT


    you describe the site you want and Claude writes the entire premium build for
    you


    start with a prompt for a storytelling layout where every scroll section reveals
    a new chapter with fluid color transitions


    it wires in Three.js for a painted texture background that reacts to your cursor


    then GSAP ScrollTrigger makes each section animate in like a cinematic scene


    Lenis handles that buttery smooth scroll the expensive studios charge a fortune
    for


    Splitting.js animates each word letter by letter as you scroll past it


    you mix a Playfair Display serif with Inter sans for that editorial tension


    the whole thing looks like a six figure agency project and it came out of a few
    prompts


    this is the same idea behind how I run my company with one person and Claude doing
    the heavy build


    start now while clients still think this needs a full design team


    i am releasing a full guide on how i built websites with claude tomorrow


    hope u see it'
